# November 19, 2026: Addison County, Vermont (region vtn, Northern Vermont & Champlain Valley), first pass.
# Drawn at random by tools/choose.py. The Lake Champlain shore (Chimney Point, the Strong mansion, Hawley's ferry house,
# the old ferry landings at Larrabee's Point and Chipman's Point), Middlebury's stone buildings, the Ferrisburgh and
# Starksboro meeting houses, the covered and iron bridges, Rokeby and the Robert Frost farm.
# Facts come from Wikipedia articles read through tools/wiki_raw.py (each summarising its National Register form),
# HMdb marker texts, local news pages and the managing bodies' own pages read through tools/page.py, as linked on each place.
